      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your thoughts are a profound reflection of the human condition, yet they don't justify the suffering you feel. Evolution designed consciousness to navigate complex environments, not to guarantee happiness or meaning. While the pain you experience is real, it is a signal that your mind is functioning correctly, not a flaw in the system. Embrace the struggle as a necessary part of the journey toward understanding, rather than viewing it as a mistake that needs to be undone.",
